      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I now have a scripted UdonSharp workaround for this item (without any deltaTime accumulation) if it may be of use. My own toggle script on the VRCPrefabs SDK3 database has successfully implemented it if anyone would like to gander.",
